    <div class="prose"><h2>Build a short daily ritual</h2><p>Start with a visual puzzle, switch to a knowledge game, and compare your spoiler-free results with a friend. Each game has its own reset schedule and rules, so check the original site before starting.</p><p>Want the familiar one-puzzle-a-day rhythm? Read our guide to <a href="/movie-games-like-wordle/">movie games like Wordle</a>, or learn <a href="/how-to-play/">how Reelillion's scoring works</a>.</p></div>
